:: Start
<div class="centre">
	<h1>Simulator Dating</h1>
	<p class="image">[Image of: a big pink heart with a crack in it]</p>
	<div class="choix">[[PLAY|Intro_Prenoms]]</div>
</div>

:: Intro_Prenoms
<h2>Who are you?</h2>
<p>Your name : <<textbox "$prenom" "">></p>
<p>Her name : <<textbox "$prenomFille" "Idiou">></p>
<p class="petit">Choose carefully. Or don't. Nobody reads names anyway.</p>
<div class="choix">
	<<link "Next" "Intro_Difficulte">>
		<<if $prenom is "">><<set $prenom to "Player">><</if>>
		<<if $prenomFille is "">><<set $prenomFille to "Idiou">><</if>>
	<</link>>
</div>


:: Intro_Difficulte
<h2>Choose the difficulty</h2>
<p>Same girl. Same face. Completely different personality. Scientists still can't explain it.</p>
<div class="mode">
	<div class="choix">[[🐶 EASY : Golden Retriever Mode|DM_1_Accroche][$difficile to false]]</div>
	<p>She had her morning coffee. Then a second one. Then a third one. Then she saw a dog. She loves everything and everyone. Probably even you.</p>
</div>
<div class="mode">
	<div class="choix">[[🧊 HARD : Left On Read Mode|DM_1_Accroche][$difficile to true]]</div>
	<p>She didn't have her coffee. Her phone is at 2%. She has 847 unread messages, and yours will be number 848.</p>
</div>
<p><label><<checkbox "$sansRetour" false true>> <b>No take-backs mode :</b> the Back button is disabled. Like in real life. One mistake and you start over.</label></p>
